+## A man's buttocks don't roll on a chair the way a capsule rolls on a box: with nothing holding him
+## to it the seat tipped back 33 degrees under his pelvis while it turned 9, his feet stayed planted,
+## his legs pushed his knees up and he folded forward and sank (experiments/physics_lab,
+## results/2026-10-24_chair_tip). Held, he goes over with the chair, about its front legs, his back
